{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f382df8822b6cfe715fb80eae75eea16bf48a7e545ce95db6a7da4e9688b6944", "ja": "今日の仕事はサイン会だ。\n麗花、緊張は……してないか。", "zh": "今天的工作是签名会。\n丽花，你……不会紧张啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "462d6a9604e1e160a44e3fd1c1793bd026f5f5386966900429baa2eff281177e", "ja": "はい♪　私、サイン会が楽しみで楽しみで\n昨日はぐーっすり眠れました！ふふっ♪", "zh": "是的♪我好期待好期待签名会，\n昨天睡了一顿好觉喔！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c91cd3a9bbc0d704960ad21a886ae52b0057ec19dcf06b583b235ac0393f595f", "ja": "快眠はいいことだけど、緊張感がなさすぎて、\n逆に心配になってきたな……。", "zh": "睡得好是好事，但太过缺乏紧张感，\n反而令人担心啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "0d6aa59a69251f236268455e615af90e65ca544a3b016c999406e66408aad6da", "ja": "えーっ、そうですか？　そんな心配性の\n{$P$}さんには……。", "zh": "咦～是这样吗？为了这么爱操心的\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "4d833d7956ef4f781dd7fe0a3ef64b8c69844e99208a7afa410c80b2bd3b5d4b", "ja": "あ、予備の色紙、1枚もらいますね！\nキュキュキュっと書いて、と……。", "zh": "啊，我拿一张备用的签名板喔！\n咻咻咻地写……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "fba796dfb217caed99331b0f3b8344586afe100cbcdd7b481fa71678fb21ad09", "ja": "はい、私のサインをプレゼントです！\n今日も一緒に、頑張りましょう♪", "zh": "来，我的签名送给你！\n今天也一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
